desktop/src-tauri/binaries/
cmd/desktop/

# Go-embeddable dashboard build artifact
cmd/bot/dashboarddist/

# ai
.codex/
.ai/

# 代理工作区笔记（个人记忆，不随项目分发）
MEMORY.md

